  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview (透過SAP GUI Scripting API，去設定畫面上垂直滾動軸(Vertical Scrollbar)的位置，讓畫面自動捲動到指定的滾軸位置，不用手動拖拉滑鼠滾輪。)&#xA;Set the specified property of Gui Vertical Scrollbar Object using SAP Gui Scripiting API. &#xA;&#xA;- Input/Output&#xA;in_ScreenId as Screen Session ID &lt;Int32&gt;&#xA;in_Position as Position &lt;Int32&gt;" DisplayName="SRC_Set_GuiVerticalScrollbar" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="939,2044" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_1">
