    <ui:Comment sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="核心動作 — 用InvokeCode執行VB.NET程式碼&#xD;&#xA;這支流程的核心邏輯全部包在一個InvokeCode活動裡，用VB.NET程式碼透過「反射(Reflection)」的方式一層層挖進SAP GUI物件，最後找到垂直滾動軸並設定它的位置。整個過程可以拆成以下幾個步驟來理解：&#xD;&#xA;1. GetObject(&quot;SAPGUI&quot;)：先抓取目前正在執行的SAP GUI應用程式物件(SapGuiAuto)&#xD;&#xA;2. GetScriptingEngine：從SapGuiAuto取得「腳本引擎(Scripting Engine)」物件，稱為application&#xD;&#xA;3. application.Children(0)：取得第一個SAP連線(connection)&#xD;&#xA;4. connection.Children(0)：取得該連線下的第一個Session(session)&#xD;&#xA;5. session.findById(&quot;wnd[&quot; &amp; in_ScreenId &amp; &quot;]/usr&quot;)：透過in_ScreenId組成的路徑字串，定位到指定視窗的使用者區域控制項(ControlID)&#xD;&#xA;6. ControlID.VerticalScrollbar：取得該控制項底下的「垂直滾動軸」物件(VScroll)&#xD;&#xA;7. VScroll.Position = in_Position：這就是真正的動作 — 把垂直滾動軸的Position屬性設定成in_Position傳入的數值，SAP畫面就會自動捲動到對應位置&#xD;&#xA;" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,461" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_1" Text="// Write your comments in the Text property">
      <sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
        <scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, x:Object">
          <x:Boolean x:Key="IsAnnotationDocked">True</x:Boolean>
        </scg:Dictionary>
      </sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
    </ui:Comment>
    <ui:Comment sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="釋放資源(重要細節)&#xD;&#xA;程式碼用了巢狀的Try...Finally結構，從最內層的VScroll物件開始，一路往外到ControlID、session、connection、application、SapGuiAuto，每一層都會在Finally區塊呼叫Marshal.ReleaseComObject(最外層則用FinalReleaseComObject)來釋放COM物件，並在最後執行GC.Collect()與GC.WaitForPendingFinalizers()強制回收記憶體。&#xD;&#xA;💡 為什麼要這樣做？ 因為SAP GUI Scripting是透過COM介接技術操作的，如果沒有正確釋放COM物件，長時間執行下來會造成記憶體或COM資源洩漏，甚至讓SAP GUI連線變得不穩定。這是SAP GUI Scripting操作的標準防護寫法。" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,313" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_3" Text="// Write your comments in the Text property">
      <sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
        <scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, x:Object">
          <x:Boolean x:Key="IsAnnotationDocked">True</x:Boolean>
        </scg:Dictionary>
      </sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
    </ui:Comment>
    <ui:Comment sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,186" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_4" Text="為什麼要這樣做？ 因為SAP GUI Scripting是透過COM介接技術操作的，如果沒有正確釋放COM物件，長時間執行下來會造成記憶體或COM資源洩漏，甚至讓SAP GUI連線變得不穩定。這是SAP GUI Scripting操作的標準防護寫法。" />
    <ui:Comment sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,206" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_5" Text="這支流程就是一個「設定SAP畫面垂直滾軸位置」的小工具：給定視窗編號(in_ScreenId)和目標位置(in_Position)，它就會透過COM反射技術找到對應的滾動軸物件並直接改變它的Position值，讓畫面捲動到指定位置，同時確保執行完畢後妥善釋放所有COM資源。" />
    <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" Code="'-Begin-----------------------------------------------------------------&#xA;Dim SapGuiAuto As Object = Nothing&#xA;Try&#xA; SapGuiAuto = GetObject(&quot;SAPGUI&quot;)&#xA; Dim application As Object = Nothing&#xA; Try&#xA;  application = SapGuiAuto.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;GetScriptingEngine&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.InvokeMethod, Nothing, SapGuiAuto, Nothing)&#xA;  Dim connection As Object = Nothing&#xA;  Try&#xA;   connection = application.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;Children&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.GetProperty, Nothing, application, {0})&#xA;   Dim session As Object = Nothing&#xA;   Try&#xA;    session = connection.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;Children&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.GetProperty, Nothing, connection, {0})&#xA;    Dim ControlID As Object = Nothing&#xA;    Try&#xA;     ControlID = session.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;findById&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.InvokeMethod, Nothing, session, {&quot;wnd[&quot; &amp; in_ScreenId.ToString &amp; &quot;]/usr&quot;})&#xA;     Dim VScroll As Object = Nothing&#xA;     Try&#xA;      VScroll = ControlID.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;VerticalScrollbar&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.GetProperty, Nothing, ControlID, Nothing)&#xA;      VScroll.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;Position&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.SetProperty, Nothing, VScroll, {in_Position})&#xA;     Finally&#xA;      Try&#xA;       System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.ReleaseComObject(VScroll)&#xA;      Catch ex As Exception&#xA;      End Try&#xA;     End Try&#xA;    Finally&#xA;     Try&#xA;      System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.ReleaseComObject(ControlID)&#xA;     Catch ex As Exception&#xA;     End Try&#xA;    End Try&#xA;   Finally&#xA;    Try&#xA;     System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.ReleaseComObject(session)&#xA;    Catch ex As Exception&#xA;    End Try&#xA;   End Try   &#xA;  Finally&#xA;   Try&#xA;    System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.ReleaseComObject(connection)&#xA;   Catch ex As Exception&#xA;   End Try&#xA;  End Try  &#xA; Finally&#xA;  Try&#xA;   System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.ReleaseComObject(application)&#xA;  Catch ex As Exception&#xA;  End Try&#xA; End Try&#xA;Finally&#xA; Try&#xA;  System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.FinalReleaseComObject(SapGuiAuto)&#xA;  System.GC.Collect()&#xA;  System.GC.WaitForPendingFinalizers()&#xA; Catch ex As Exception&#xA; End Try&#xA;End Try" DisplayName="Invoke code for GuiScrollbar.VerticalScrollbar" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,287" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_1">
